<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>OSH™ — Homeostatic Semantic Organism</title>
<meta name="description" content="OSH™ — A computational paradigm not based on Transformers for Artificial Intelligence.">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.6}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}

.bg-dots{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:0.05;background-image:radial-gradient(#f26522 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:28px 28px}

.content{position:relative;z-index:1}
.container{width:100%;max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}

.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;border:none;font-family:inherit;transition:opacity .15s ease}
.btn-primary{background:#f26522;color:#fff}
.btn-primary:hover{opacity:.85}
.btn-outline{border:1.5px solid #f26522;color:#f26522;background:transparent}
.btn-outline:hover{background:#f26522;color:#fff}
.btn-lg{padding:14px 36px;font-size:15px}

section{padding:80px 0}
.section-label{font-size:11px;color:#f26522;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:500}
.section-title{font-size:clamp(26px,4.5vw,42px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.1;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:48px}

.border-t-orange{border-top:2px solid #f26522}
.border-b-orange{border-bottom:2px solid #f26522}

.card{padding:24px;border:1.5px solid #f26522;border-radius:10px}
.card-muted{padding:24px;border:1.5px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px}
.card h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:#f26522;margin-bottom:8px}
.card p,.card-muted p{font-size:14px;color:#444;line-height:1.6}
.card-muted h3{color:#1a1a1a}
.card-muted .num{color:#ccc;font-size:32px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:10px}

.grid-4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:24px}
.grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:20px}

.hero{min-height:90vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:80px 20px}
.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:6px 16px;border:1.5px solid #f26522;border-radius:999px}
.hero-badge span:first-child{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f26522;display:inline-block}
.hero-badge span:last-child{font-size:12px;color:#f26522;letter-spacing:.04em;font-weight:500}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(52px,10vw,96px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:12px}
.hero .subtitle{font-size:clamp(20px,3.5vw,32px);font-weight:500;color:#f26522;margin-bottom:16px}
.hero .desc{font-size:clamp(15px,2.2vw,20px);color:#444;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}

.stat-num{font-size:36px;font-weight:500;color:#f26522;margin-bottom:6px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.stat-text{font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.5}

.cta-section{padding:100px 20px;text-align:center}
.cta-section h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3.5vw,32px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:24px}

footer{padding:40px 20px;border-top:2px solid #f26522}
.footer-inner{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
footer p{font-size:13px;color:#999}
footer .brand{color:#f26522;font-weight:500}

@media(max-width:600px){
  .hero-actions{flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
  .btn{width:100%;max-width:280px}
  section{padding:60px 0}
  .cta-section{padding:60px 20px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bg-dots"></div>
<div class="content">

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">
    <span></span>
    <span>functional prototype — seeking strategic partnership</span>
  </div>
  <h1>OSH™</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Homeostatic Semantic Organism</p>
  <p class="desc">A computational paradigm not based on Transformers for Artificial Intelligence.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#architecture" class="btn btn-primary">the architecture</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">request evaluation</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="architecture" class="border-t-orange">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">the architecture</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Homeostatic Semantic Organism</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Semantic homeostasis</h3>
        <p>The system self-regulates its internal semantic state under perturbation without requiring external retraining.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Autonomous stabilization</h3>
        <p>It adapts under variable input conditions while maintaining the structural continuity of meaning.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Contextual persistence</h3>
        <p>It processes context through structural resonance, independently of traditional attention-window limits.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Continuous evolution</h3>
        <p>It accumulates knowledge and sustains structure throughout operational use.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-t-orange border-b-orange">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">implementation status</p>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <div>
        <p class="stat-num">01</p>
        <p class="stat-text">Functional software prototype implemented.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="stat-num">02</p>
        <p class="stat-text">Real-time system operation.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="stat-num">03</p>
        <p class="stat-text">Technical benchmark protocol defined (v0.1).</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="stat-num">04</p>
        <p class="stat-text">Live demonstrations and evaluable code under NDA.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="not" class="border-b-orange">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">what osh is not</p>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card-muted">
        <div class="num">01</div>
        <h3>Not a language model</h3>
        <p style="color:#666">OSH does not predict tokens. It preserves semantic continuity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-muted">
        <div class="num">02</div>
        <h3>Not a Transformer</h3>
        <p style="color:#666">No attention mechanisms. No positional encoding. Independent mathematics.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-muted">
        <div class="num">03</div>
        <h3>Not a traditional neural network</h3>
        <p style="color:#666">No backpropagation. No gradient descent. No iterative retraining.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="cta-section">
  <p class="section-label">strategic objective — technology transfer memorandum</p>
  <h2>The objective is acquisition, intellectual property licensing, strategic partnership, or independent technical evaluation by organizations capable of industrializing a new computational architecture for AI.</h2>
  <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-top:40px">
    <a href="mailto:fabian.vallejos@oshsystems.com?subject=Technical%20Evaluation%20Request%20OSH" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Request technical evaluation</a>
    <a href="mailto:fabian.vallejos@oshsystems.com" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
      fabian.vallejos@oshsystems.com
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <p>© 2026 oshsystems</p>
    <p class="brand">Homeostatic Semantic Organism</p>
  </div>
</footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
